{"id":"n28432-1-7","stage":5,"title":"내쉬다 · 呼气","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28432-1-7-1","ko":"숨을 길게 내쉬어 보세요.","zh":"请试着深长地呼气。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"숨을","meaning":"呼吸","explanation":"숨：呼吸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숨","audio":"/audio/19b65768173f5897377a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62463","senseId":"1","lemma":"숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숨을","audio":"/audio/27ab287b5261265f18d0.mp3"}},{"text":"길게","meaning":"长","explanation":"길다：长；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"길다","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26808","senseId":"4","lemma":"길다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길게","audio":"/audio/e186972cde6d8e80e56a.mp3"}},{"text":"내쉬어","meaning":"呼气，吐出","explanation":"내쉬다：呼气，吐出；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"내쉬다","audio":"/audio/7a424738b35008da87c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28432","senseId":"1","lemma":"내쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내쉬어","audio":"/audio/4d6156cffb27e259a4c9.mp3"}},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보세요","audio":"/audio/10b2f8c9f190884edd75.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"19b65768173f5897","term":"숨","zh":"呼吸","audio":"/audio/19b65768173f5897377a.mp3","entryId":"62463","definition":"人或动物通过鼻子或嘴吸入和呼出空气的行为。","pronunciation":["숨ː"]},{"id":"013e520a738e476f","term":"길다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3","entryId":"26808","definition":"声音或叹气等长时间持续。","pronunciation":["길ː다"]},{"id":"7a424738b35008da","term":"내쉬다","zh":"呼气，吐出","audio":"/audio/7a424738b35008da87c3.mp3","entryId":"28432","definition":"把呼吸的气息排出体外。","pronunciation":["내ː쉬다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/600503400e542940403f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28432-1-7-2","ko":"숨을 계속 내보냈더니 어지러워요.","zh":"一直呼气的话，我会觉得头晕。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"숨을","meaning":"呼吸","explanation":"숨：呼吸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숨","audio":"/audio/19b65768173f5897377a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62463","senseId":"1","lemma":"숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숨을","audio":"/audio/27ab287b5261265f18d0.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"내보냈더니","meaning":"排放","explanation":"내보내다：排放；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"내보내다","audio":"/audio/c2c51426c0ebeeb8f180.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28428","senseId":"2","lemma":"내보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내보냈더니","audio":"/audio/35e44c3265852e713adc.mp3"}},{"text":"어지러워요.","meaning":"晕，晕眩","explanation":"어지럽다：晕，晕眩；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어지럽다","audio":"/audio/1e2f790342e5cbb65c1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14588","senseId":"1","lemma":"어지럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어지러워요","audio":"/audio/1a07de9516e0793264be.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"19b65768173f5897","term":"숨","zh":"呼吸","audio":"/audio/19b65768173f5897377a.mp3","entryId":"62463","definition":"人或动物通过鼻子或嘴吸入和呼出空气的行为。","pronunciation":["숨ː"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"c2